  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.55,
      "end": 4.596,
      "text": "Gulf desalination plants run on fixed setpoints and fixed alarms."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.149,
      "end": 8.55,
      "text": "By the time an alarm fires, the plant is already reacting."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.3,
      "end": 14.328,
      "text": "AquaTwin keeps a physics model of each reverse-osmosis train calibrated to live data,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.731,
      "end": 16.431,
      "text": "and corrects it with machine learning."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.022,
      "end": 19.732,
      "text": "Train 2, it tells us, is due for cleaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.5,
      "end": 23.987,
      "text": "Before a salinity shock arrives, it simulates the next day."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.486,
      "end": 27.557,
      "text": "Doing nothing breaks the water-quality limit within three hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.053,
      "end": 30.441,
      "text": "AquaTwin's plan holds every constraint."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.15,
      "end": 33.814,
      "text": "It weighs 676 strategies,"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.254,
      "end": 36.089,
      "text": "and a safety layer, AquaGuard,"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.426,
      "end": 39.278,
      "text": "checks every limit at the edge of the model's uncertainty."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.95,
      "end": 42.642,
      "text": "And when conditions go beyond what the model has learned,"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.956,
      "end": 45.283,
      "text": "it says so, and withholds its advice."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.95,
      "end": 49.256,
      "text": "Every result is simulated, tested against a hidden plant,"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.525,
      "end": 52.137,
      "text": "and reproducible, including where it doesn't help."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.1,
      "end": 55.803,
      "text": "AquaTwin. Predict, simulate, adapt,"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.007,
      "end": 57.665,
      "text": "before the plant is forced to react."
    }
  ],
